			"Message": "docs(Maintain): Fix DeepDive opening sentence and add project footer links\n\nFix the opening sentence of the DeepDive document that was missing a word and\nread awkwardly. The original introductory clause referred to itself as \"This\ndocument\" rather than stating Maintain's role directly.\n\nAdd a standardized footer section at the bottom of the document with project\nmaintainer contact, GitHub repository link, and a link to report issues,\naligning the DeepDive with the README's convention for project meta-links.\n\nNo content or technical claims are altered — only presentation fixes.",
