			"Message": "docs(Maintain): Rewrite README with comprehensive architecture documentation\n\nExpand the README from a brief two-sentence description to a full project\ndocument covering Maintain's three core capabilities: deterministic build\norchestration, AST-level dead-code elimination via `syn`, and profile-based\ndevelopment runner with hot-reload support.\n\nKey additions include a mission statement describing reproducible builds, an\narchitecture principles table (Determinism, Scriptability, Type Safety, Safe\nCode Transformation, Modularity), an updated Mermaid diagram with the\nEliminate module pipeline, a complete file tree of all Source directories\nand tests, Security and Compatibility sections with emoji decorations, and\nfixed doc URL references.\n\nThe project description is updated from \"Build System & CI/CD Toolkit\" to\n\"Build System, Dead-Code Eliminator & Development Runner\" to accurately\nreflect Maintain's expanded scope.",
